{"unit_id":"ricardochen1996__dsh-browser-use#feature-1","repo":"ricardochen1996/dsh-browser-use","commit":"dfe8bfc5221cb6573c1a29bb258059f9a430cd0d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-browser-use 的功能「页面观测与动作」：browser_open 打开网址并返回可操作元素表，browser_page 重新读取页面，browser_act 对指定观测中的元素执行一次点击、输入、选择、滚动或等待。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:174-230","lib/tools.js:22-26"]}
